## How to verify a finding

For any specific number that matters:

1. Look up the row in `data/processed/{{PROJECT_SLUG}}.csv`.
2. Join to `provenance.csv` on `(source, vintage)` to get the source
   URL, retrieval timestamp, and file sha256.
3. Cross-check against the corresponding original under
   `data/original/<source>/<vintage>/`.

The published Datasette instance exposes this join as a canned query
named `with_provenance` — see
[the Datasette URL](https://{{PROJECT_SLUG}}.vercel.app/).
